  concept: "Authored objective: Execute Precision Orbital Rendezvous.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from the electrical graph, valid calibrated feedback and the level\u2019s
    verified run history. voltage \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching
    principle: Mission control must respect the authored states, calibrated references
    and safety constraints; simulation evidence is required before declaring a maneuver
    complete.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this objective
    is complete."
